      "seed": 342601193,
      "version": 1250,
      "versionNonce": 184064039,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780812367464,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non- functional requirments\n\n- availability >> consistency (Always\n  explain wrt your problem, if we\n  upload or change the file in lets say\n  india and someone in germany looks\n  just after updating it still see the\n  previous verison of the file.\n- upload and download time for the files should\n  be low as low as possible\n- Support large file storage (50 GB)\n- The system should be secure and reliable",
      "fontSize": 12.136377639524186,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non- functional requirments\n\n- availability >> consistency (Always\n  explain wrt your problem, if we\n  upload or change the file in lets say\n  india and someone in germany looks\n  just after updating it still see the\n  previous verison of the file.\n- upload and download time for the files should\n  be low as low as possible\n- Support large file storage (50 GB)\n- The system should be secure and reliable",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
