      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1679835209,
      "version": 890,
      "versionNonce": 1166338825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1780832745788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep Dives:-\n\n- How to store large file (50 GB)\n  we can achieve this using chunking: Split the large into smaller chunks (5-10MB each)\n  In this way large size file can be stored to a blob storage\n  in the blob storage, when all the chunks are stored, it will stitch all the chunks to a single full size file\n\n- How to make the sync as fast as possible\n  By chunking and using CDN we can make the process very fast\n\n- How to reduce upload and downlaod latency\n  By chunking it will boost up the upload speed\n  By using CDN we can make the download process very fast.\n  We can also use some compression techniques to speed up the\n  download and upload speed.\n\n- How to ensure secuiryt\n  S3 has built in encryption which will encrypt the file and store the key\n  somewhere else so that no other can access the file.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep Dives:-\n\n- How to store large file (50 GB)\n  we can achieve this using chunking: Split the large into smaller chunks (5-10MB each)\n  In this way large size file can be stored to a blob storage\n  in the blob storage, when all the chunks are stored, it will stitch all the chunks to a single full size file\n\n- How to make the sync as fast as possible\n  By chunking and using CDN we can make the process very fast\n\n- How to reduce upload and downlaod latency\n  By chunking it will boost up the upload speed\n  By using CDN we can make the download process very fast.\n  We can also use some compression techniques to speed up the\n  download and upload speed.\n\n- How to ensure secuiryt\n  S3 has built in encryption which will encrypt the file and store the key\n  somewhere else so that no other can access the file.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
